= Wahl zum Berlin Abgeordnetenhaus, [+ month : month +] [+ year +]

The regularly scheduled elections for the Berlin Abgeordnetenhaus are to take place. The incumbent government is a <span style="color: [+ linke_colour +];">Rot</span>-<span style="color: [+ spd_colour +];">Rot</span>-<span style="color: [+ greens_colour +];">Grün</span> government, with our party being in government, led by Michael Müller. 
  
Concurrent to this, a expropiation referendum which will affect 12 businesses will take place, and we are confident that it will end in a victory for the Yes side. The Borough council elections are also held in the same day. Lot of things. Now, we have to go to the voting..

- @berlin: May we do our best...

